USERADD:
--------
/etc/passwd = username : x : UID : GID : GECOS(Full Name,Office,Office Phone,Home Phone) : HOME : SHELL
example: rohal:x:1000:1000:Rohal,,,:/home/rohal:/bin/bash

cut command to get user related information:
-------------------------------------------
FAST COMMANDS TO GET EACH ATTRIBUTE
# Username cut -d: -f1 /etc/passwd
# UID cut -d: -f3 /etc/passwd
# GID (Primary group) cut -d: -f4 /etc/passwd
# Home directory cut -d: -f6 /etc/passwd
# Login shell cut -d: -f7 /etc/passwd

For a specific user: getent passwd rohal

GROUP:
-----
/etc/group = group_name : x : GID : user_list

FAST COMMANDS TO GET GROUP ATTRIBUTES
# Group name cut -d: -f1 /etc/group
# GID	cut -d: -f3 /etc/group
# Members	cut -d: -f4 /etc/group

Show specific group: getent group wheel
Show user’s primary group: id rohal
Show all groups of current user: groups

